The error TypeError: Could not convert 'WAP001' to numeric indicates that the   
CSV files actually contain a header row (e.g., "WAP001", "WAP002"...), but the  
code was loading them with header=None. This caused the first row of data to be 
treated as strings, which then broke the variance calculation.                  

